               <title>Inactive ingredients</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>butylparaben, carboxymethylcellulose sodium, cellulose, citric acid, corn syrup, D&amp;C red #33. FD&amp;C red # 40, flavor, glycerin, propylene glycol, water, sodium benzoate, sorbitol, xanthan gum, Sodium saccharin.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20130403"/>
            </section>
         </component>
